40
00:01:23,430 --> 00:01:27,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="19"><b><font face="HP Simplified"><font color="#d1dde9">right here right now (burn) let's slash right through and get the fire, bang!</font></font></b></font></font>

41
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:49,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I never thought he'd attempt to use
the Fourth Hokage's Jutsu.</font>

42
00:01:49,830 --> 00:01:51,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But it's still just this level...</font>

43
00:01:52,050 --> 00:01:54,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's completely different
from the original one.</font>

44
00:01:55,720 --> 00:01:59,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Tsunade...
Incredibly strong as always.</font>

45
00:02:01,010 --> 00:02:03,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I remember a long time ago,</font>

46
00:02:03,140 --> 00:02:06,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">getting punched by her and
knocked back nearly 100 meters...</font>

47
00:02:08,480 --> 00:02:11,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At any rate, Naruto's hopeless.</font>

48
00:02:12,190 --> 00:02:13,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay?</font>

49
00:02:14,940 --> 00:02:16,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiraiya, was it you...</font>

50
00:02:16,900 --> 00:02:18,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who taught him that Rasengan?</font>

51
00:02:19,740 --> 00:02:20,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan...?!</font>

52
00:02:21,490 --> 00:02:25,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm his teacher, after all.</font>

53
00:02:26,080 --> 00:02:30,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph... You and the Fourth Hokage are
the only ones who can use that Jutsu.</font>

54
00:02:31,210 --> 00:02:33,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you in your right mind...</font>

55
00:02:33,840 --> 00:02:35,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">showing someone Jutsu
that he can't master?</font>

56
00:02:36,510 --> 00:02:38,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't give him false hope.</font>

57
00:02:38,880 --> 00:02:44,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why the oblivious kid starts joking
about becoming a Hokage!</font>

58
00:02:44,850 --> 00:02:48,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no joke! Stupid! Stupid!</font>

59
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:51,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I have three days,
I'll master this Jutsu!</font>

60
00:02:52,810 --> 00:02:54,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said it, kid.</font>

61
00:02:55,570 --> 00:02:57,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Men don't go back on their word!</font>

62
00:02:57,690 --> 00:03:01,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! I stand by my words.</font>

63
00:03:02,370 --> 00:03:04,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's my Ninja Way.</font>

64
00:03:10,040 --> 00:03:12,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then... how about a wager?</font>

65
00:03:13,710 --> 00:03:14,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A wager...?</font>

66
00:03:15,290 --> 00:03:16,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll give you one week.</font>

67
00:03:17,260 --> 00:03:19,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you can master that Jutsu,</font>

68
00:03:20,050 --> 00:03:22,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll acknowledge that you have
what it takes to become the Hokage</font>

69
00:03:22,390 --> 00:03:24,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and give you this necklace.</font>

70
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:27,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama! That's the precious...!</font>

71
00:03:28,060 --> 00:03:30,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't need such a sorry necklace!</font>

72
00:03:31,140 --> 00:03:32,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say such things, Naruto...</font>

73
00:03:32,940 --> 00:03:35,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the only one of its kind in this
world.</font>

74
00:03:35,440 --> 00:03:37,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you could buy three mountains
if you were to sell it.</font>

75
00:03:38,570 --> 00:03:41,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It belonged to the First Hokage.</font>

76
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A-Awesome...</font>

77
00:03:44,780 --> 00:03:47,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, that'll be fine!</font>

78
00:03:48,540 --> 00:03:50,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He'll do anything for money...?</font>

79
00:03:50,660 --> 00:03:51,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good...</font>

80
00:03:51,790 --> 00:03:56,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, you lose if you can't master
the Jutsu in one week!</font>

81
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you'll give me all the money
you have on you.</font>

82
00:03:58,840 --> 00:04:00,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Gama-Chan!</font>

83
00:04:00,760 --> 00:04:01,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When did she...?!</font>

84
00:04:02,430 --> 00:04:04,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama! Why?</font>

85
00:04:04,140 --> 00:04:05,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That necklace is...</font>

86
00:04:06,640 --> 00:04:08,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He won't be able to do it, anyway...</font>

87
00:04:08,510 --> 00:04:09,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, Shizune.</font>

88
00:04:10,520 --> 00:04:14,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She never once used
that necklace for a bet...</font>

89
00:04:16,940 --> 00:04:19,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have to answer right now.</font>

90
00:04:20,110 --> 00:04:22,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, I want it in a week.</font>

91
00:04:28,030 --> 00:04:34,040
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">The First Hokage's</font>

92
00:04:28,030 --> 00:04:34,040
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Inheritance</font>

93
00:04:28,030 --> 00:04:34,040
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5"><font size="40">The Necklace That</font></font>

94
00:04:28,030 --> 00:04:34,040
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Calls Upon Death</font>

95
00:04:36,710 --> 00:04:40,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Who is it this late at night?</font>

96
00:04:41,210 --> 00:04:44,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay, okay. I'm coming.</font>

97
00:04:46,090 --> 00:04:50,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry to bother you so late, Naruto-kun.
I need to talk to you...</font>

98
00:04:51,060 --> 00:04:54,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As for me, I'm going to get
a good night's rest and train tomorrow!</font>

99
00:04:55,020 --> 00:04:59,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm sorry. But I didn't want you
to misunderstand Tsunade-sama...</font>

100
00:05:01,110 --> 00:05:03,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As well as the necklace...</font>

101
00:05:04,110 --> 00:05:07,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph! I couldn't care less
about an old lady like that!</font>

102
00:05:07,110 --> 00:05:09,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama is not the type
of person you think she is!</font>

103
00:05:09,620 --> 00:05:12,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't speak of her like that
when you don't even know her!</font>

104
00:05:16,580 --> 00:05:18,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I'm sorry... for raising my voice.</font>

105
00:05:20,460 --> 00:05:23,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She didn't used to be like that.</font>

106
00:05:23,840 --> 00:05:27,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She was a kind person
who loved the village.</font>

107
00:05:28,680 --> 00:05:31,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, she changed...</font>

108
00:05:36,020 --> 00:05:37,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After that day...</font>

109
00:05:39,190 --> 00:05:40,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That day?</font>

110
00:05:43,150 --> 00:05:44,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that day?</font>

111
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:51,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The day she lost her dreams,
her love, her hopes... everything.</font>

112
00:05:53,910 --> 00:05:58,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All that was left was
that necklace of memories...</font>

113
00:06:00,330 --> 00:06:04,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's as precious as life to Tsunade-sama.</font>

114
00:06:04,710 --> 00:06:08,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's really not something
to be offered in a bet.</font>

115
00:06:09,550 --> 00:06:13,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't care about that!
She bet it on her own, right?!</font>

116
00:06:13,640 --> 00:06:17,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides... that necklace is really
not something for you to wear.</font>

117
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:19,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not just a necklace!</font>

118
00:06:21,310 --> 00:06:23,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It doesn't acknowledge anyone
other than Tsunade-sama.</font>

119
00:06:24,440 --> 00:06:29,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If someone else wears it,
that person inevitably...</font>

120
00:06:30,990 --> 00:06:31,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...dies!</font>

121
00:06:54,720 --> 00:06:58,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nawaki, happy twelfth birthday!</font>

122
00:07:01,020 --> 00:07:05,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not a kid anymore,
so I don't need gifts on my birthday!</font>

123
00:07:05,110 --> 00:07:08,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're you saying?
You're still a kid, aren't you?!</font>

124
00:07:09,240 --> 00:07:11,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But never mind that.
Hurry up and open your present!</font>

125
00:07:11,610 --> 00:07:13,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You'll definitely be pleased!</font>

126
00:07:20,540 --> 00:07:22,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nee-chan, could this be...?</font>

127
00:07:23,630 --> 00:07:28,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes... It's the First Hokage's,
our grandfather's necklace!</font>

128
00:07:28,710 --> 00:07:30,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I love you, nee-chan!</font>

129
00:07:31,260 --> 00:07:33,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought it'd be better than me having it.</font>

130
00:07:34,390 --> 00:07:39,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've been wanting it all along, right?
Take good care of it.</font>

131
00:07:39,850 --> 00:07:41,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not just this necklace!</font>

132
00:07:42,940 --> 00:07:48,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This village is grandfather's treasure!
I'm going to protect it!</font>

133
00:07:49,570 --> 00:07:50,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nawaki...</font>

134
00:07:51,150 --> 00:07:55,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the grandson of the Hokage who
built the Village Hidden in Leaves, so...!</font>

135
00:07:56,530 --> 00:07:59,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You said it.
Men don't go back on their word!</font>

136
00:07:59,870 --> 00:08:00,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

137
00:08:00,790 --> 00:08:04,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Someday, I'll become just like Grandfather.
And the Hokage name will be mine!</font>

138
00:08:06,460 --> 00:08:09,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Becoming the Hokage is my dream!</font>

139
00:08:13,130 --> 00:08:15,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take off your headband, Nawaki.</font>

140
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:19,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just hurry up and take it off.
I have another present for you.</font>

141
00:08:22,350 --> 00:08:24,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a charm to make
your dream come true.</font>

142
00:08:51,510 --> 00:08:54,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's best if you don't look
at the remains.</font>

143
00:08:55,510 --> 00:08:57,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nothing wrong with that,
is there?</font>

144
00:08:57,640 --> 00:08:59,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if she were to look,</font>

145
00:08:59,640 --> 00:09:02,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">she wouldn't be able to determine
that it's her little brother.</font>

146
00:09:02,480 --> 00:09:03,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enough, Orochimaru!</font>

147
00:09:04,600 --> 00:09:10,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We are at war, now.
All Shinobi end up like this.</font>

148
00:09:10,780 --> 00:09:13,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There are no doctors on
the battlefield, so...</font>

149
00:09:14,280 --> 00:09:18,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, children really get
much too excited, don't they?</font>

150
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:22,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Especially on the day after
they receive a present.</font>

151
00:09:33,300 --> 00:09:35,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not just this necklace...</font>

152
00:09:38,550 --> 00:09:43,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This village is grandfather's treasure!
I'm going to protect it!</font>

153
00:09:45,940 --> 00:09:48,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, in a mission where
a Four-Man Cell must act alone</font>

154
00:09:48,690 --> 00:09:52,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for a long period of time
in enemy territory,</font>

155
00:09:52,570 --> 00:09:55,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">by deploying one of the four
to be a medical specialist,</font>

156
00:09:55,990 --> 00:09:59,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the survival rate as well as
the mission success rate</font>

157
00:09:59,320 --> 00:10:00,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">should go up significantly.</font>

158
00:10:01,490 --> 00:10:02,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, establishing a framework</font>

159
00:10:03,040 --> 00:10:04,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to foster Ninja possessing
advanced medical skills</font>

160
00:10:04,910 --> 00:10:06,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the development of
a medical institution</font>

161
00:10:06,540 --> 00:10:11,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">should be considered
an urgent task for the present!</font>

162
00:10:12,380 --> 00:10:16,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes indeed, it's as you say.</font>

163
00:10:16,880 --> 00:10:18,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we're in the middle of a war now.</font>

164
00:10:19,430 --> 00:10:23,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It takes too much time to
establish a medical framework.</font>

165
00:10:23,760 --> 00:10:26,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And at present,
we don't have enough knowledge...</font>

166
00:10:26,770 --> 00:10:29,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Enemies don't wait.</font>

167
00:10:30,190 --> 00:10:32,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you say?! Hey, old man!</font>

168
00:10:32,610 --> 00:10:34,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then we'll never...</font>

169
00:10:34,730 --> 00:10:37,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I agree with her.</font>

170
00:10:37,740 --> 00:10:41,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want the lives of the Shinobi
who died to be for naught.</font>

171
00:10:42,370 --> 00:10:44,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There should be something
we can learn from that.</font>

172
00:10:48,210 --> 00:10:49,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Excuse me!</font>

173
00:10:50,210 --> 00:10:51,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks for earlier.</font>

174
00:10:53,380 --> 00:10:55,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What you said was right.</font>

175
00:10:57,590 --> 00:10:58,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Umm...</font>

176
00:10:59,550 --> 00:11:02,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's late.
Shall I walk you home?</font>

177
00:11:02,600 --> 00:11:05,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? Is that okay with you?
Where's your home?</font>

178
00:11:06,720 --> 00:11:07,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The other way.</font>

179
00:11:08,350 --> 00:11:09,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then don't bother.</font>

180
00:11:10,100 --> 00:11:13,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't mind.
I also want to talk with you.</font>

181
00:11:14,770 --> 00:11:19,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And I would always use this path
to the Academy to pick up my little sister.</font>

182
00:11:19,110 --> 00:11:20,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I loved this path.</font>

183
00:11:21,030 --> 00:11:22,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What? You loved?</font>

184
00:11:23,740 --> 00:11:27,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah. In the battle when the Leaf
was attacked at night one year ago,</font>

185
00:11:27,950 --> 00:11:29,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my little sister was...</font>

186
00:11:30,660 --> 00:11:33,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This man... is the same as me.</font>

187
00:11:50,680 --> 00:11:53,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tomorrow's mission will be
within enemy lines...</font>

188
00:11:55,480 --> 00:12:00,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fighting and losing cherished people
is not the only way for a Shinobi.</font>

189
00:12:00,820 --> 00:12:01,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uh-huh.</font>

190
00:12:01,860 --> 00:12:04,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm living in a world of Shinobi
where death always hovers.</font>

191
00:12:05,410 --> 00:12:09,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to risk my life to bring
this war-torn world under control.</font>

192
00:12:10,540 --> 00:12:13,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I love this village and my comrades.</font>

193
00:12:14,120 --> 00:12:16,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I want to protect them.</font>

194
00:12:17,130 --> 00:12:22,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since my little sister died,
that sole thought has sustained me.</font>

195
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:24,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I'll become the Hokage...</font>

196
00:12:25,470 --> 00:12:26,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">An existence that protects everyone...</font>

197
00:12:29,010 --> 00:12:31,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Becoming the Hokage is my dream.</font>

198
00:12:39,650 --> 00:12:40,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dan...</font>

199
00:12:46,740 --> 00:12:50,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'd like you... to take this.</font>

200
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:58,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hang on, Dan!</font>

201
00:12:59,040 --> 00:13:03,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade... I don't want... to die yet.</font>

202
00:13:04,630 --> 00:13:09,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have many things that I must... do.</font>

203
00:13:09,350 --> 00:13:10,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't talk, Dan!</font>

204
00:13:11,180 --> 00:13:13,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His kidney has been blown out...</font>

205
00:13:13,810 --> 00:13:16,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's futile even for Tsunade
who is known as one of the Sannin...</font>

206
00:13:17,650 --> 00:13:22,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... must not... die here.</font>

207
00:13:24,110 --> 00:13:26,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It'll be okay. I stopped the bleeding.</font>

208
00:13:27,450 --> 00:13:30,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it'll be okay... You'll be saved, Dan!</font>

209
00:13:32,080 --> 00:13:33,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Really?</font>

210
00:13:34,910 --> 00:13:36,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank goodness...</font>

211
00:13:38,080 --> 00:13:39,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dan! Hang on!</font>

212
00:13:40,250 --> 00:13:41,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dan!</font>

213
00:13:45,380 --> 00:13:47,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it! Don't come out...</font>

214
00:13:48,260 --> 00:13:50,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop... Please stop!</font>

215
00:13:51,260 --> 00:13:52,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop... Stop...</font>

216
00:13:53,600 --> 00:13:55,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop... Stop...</font>

217
00:13:55,520 --> 00:13:59,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop! Stop! Stop! Stop! Stop!</font>

218
00:13:59,360 --> 00:14:00,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

219
00:14:00,270 --> 00:14:01,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's enough. He's dead!</font>

220
00:14:31,550 --> 00:14:34,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You understand, don't you, Naruto-kun...?</font>

221
00:14:35,470 --> 00:14:37,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ever since that day,</font>

222
00:14:38,020 --> 00:14:40,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade-sama has been...
in a constant turmoil.</font>

223
00:14:48,950 --> 00:14:50,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...?</font>

224
00:14:51,280 --> 00:14:54,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm heading out... for training!</font>

225
00:15:20,850 --> 00:15:22,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, you are already at it, I see!</font>

226
00:15:22,560 --> 00:15:23,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hi, welcome!</font>

227
00:15:24,570 --> 00:15:25,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are you here?</font>

228
00:15:26,150 --> 00:15:29,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're cold. Don't say that.</font>

229
00:15:30,530 --> 00:15:31,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiraiya-sama...</font>

230
00:15:32,660 --> 00:15:36,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shizune, could you leave us?</font>

231
00:15:36,990 --> 00:15:39,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's been a while.
I want to drink with her again.</font>

232
00:15:40,410 --> 00:15:43,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Master, alcohol! And some radish!</font>

233
00:15:43,380 --> 00:15:44,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Coming up!</font>

234
00:15:48,010 --> 00:15:50,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm counting on you, Jiraiya-sama.</font>

235
00:15:55,680 --> 00:15:56,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your radish is ready.</font>

236
00:15:56,970 --> 00:15:58,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ooh. This looks good.</font>

237
00:16:03,060 --> 00:16:07,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At any rate, to think you'd still be taking
good care of that necklace...</font>

238
00:16:08,320 --> 00:16:11,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought you'd have lost it
long since to gambling.</font>

239
00:16:13,320 --> 00:16:15,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a memento of those two, right?</font>

240
00:16:23,170 --> 00:16:24,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he on your mind...?</font>

241
00:16:25,040 --> 00:16:26,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who?</font>

242
00:16:28,250 --> 00:16:29,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto.</font>

243
00:16:30,960 --> 00:16:31,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not particularly...</font>

244
00:16:32,880 --> 00:16:36,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Still, it's immature,
taking on that kid as an opponent...</font>

245
00:16:36,680 --> 00:16:40,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He shouldn't be able to master
that Jutsu in a week, right?</font>

246
00:16:41,270 --> 00:16:43,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not what's called a bet.</font>

247
00:16:46,150 --> 00:16:47,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with the fit of despair?</font>

248
00:16:49,020 --> 00:16:51,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not a fit of despair!</font>

249
00:16:53,700 --> 00:16:55,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you going to meet
Orochimaru again?</font>

250
00:16:57,490 --> 00:16:59,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can tell by looking at Shizune's face.</font>

251
00:17:00,120 --> 00:17:03,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what kind of deal
he proposed,</font>

252
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:06,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but don't rush to a decision.</font>

253
00:17:08,040 --> 00:17:12,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And... let me just tell you one thing.</font>

254
00:17:13,220 --> 00:17:15,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The successive line of Hokage
have protected</font>

255
00:17:15,220 --> 00:17:18,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Leaf Village and those living in it.</font>

256
00:17:18,680 --> 00:17:23,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They brought troubled times under control
and helped the village to prosper.</font>

257
00:17:23,520 --> 00:17:25,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They risked their lives
for this dream, this ideal!</font>

258
00:17:27,650 --> 00:17:31,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're not someone who can't understand
the feelings of the previous Hokage.</font>

259
00:17:32,480 --> 00:17:36,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just try doing something
to betray the Leaf Village.</font>

260
00:17:38,910 --> 00:17:42,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When that happens, I'll kill you myself!</font>

261
00:17:44,830 --> 00:17:47,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It has nothing to do with me now!</font>

262
00:17:48,540 --> 00:17:50,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A person who has experienced
the death of people close to them</font>

263
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:53,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and doesn't feel anything
is just a butcher.</font>

264
00:17:54,800 --> 00:17:56,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're different, aren't you?</font>

265
00:17:57,050 --> 00:18:01,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No one cared for the welfare
of the villagers more than you.</font>

266
00:18:03,020 --> 00:18:04,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At that time, too...</font>

267
00:18:04,350 --> 00:18:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's enough with the lecture!</font>

268
00:18:09,230 --> 00:18:13,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why... did you bring that kid?</font>

269
00:18:13,570 --> 00:18:16,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Becoming the Hokage is my dream.</font>

270
00:18:18,660 --> 00:18:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He resembles him, doesn't he?</font>

271
00:18:20,660 --> 00:18:22,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">His age is about the same, too...</font>

272
00:18:24,040 --> 00:18:25,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not just that...</font>

273
00:18:30,630 --> 00:18:33,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Becoming the Hokage is my dream!</font>

274
00:18:36,840 --> 00:18:38,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, you do nothing,
but reckless things.</font>

275
00:18:38,930 --> 00:18:40,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you want to die?</font>

276
00:18:40,470 --> 00:18:44,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're still a Genin,
so on the battlefield just run away.</font>

277
00:18:44,640 --> 00:18:47,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't tell a man to "run away"!</font>

278
00:18:49,520 --> 00:18:52,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That dream... And his cockiness as well...</font>

279
00:19:03,830 --> 00:19:09,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No good! Damn it! Damn it!
Tomorrow, for sure...!</font>

280
00:19:11,250 --> 00:19:14,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My head hurts.</font>

281
00:19:15,500 --> 00:19:18,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I totally got sick from drinking,
thanks to her...</font>

282
00:19:22,840 --> 00:19:28,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems Naruto never came home
last night...</font>

283
00:19:36,650 --> 00:19:39,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's such a fool.</font>

284
00:19:51,830 --> 00:19:54,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't we make a deal?</font>

285
00:19:55,340 --> 00:19:59,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll resurrect the little brother
and man, both of whom you loved...</font>

286
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:03,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with the Forbidden Jutsu I've developed.</font>

287
00:20:05,600 --> 00:20:09,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't you want to see those two,
Tsunade?</font>

288
00:20:15,150 --> 00:20:16,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I treat your arms...</font>

289
00:20:17,650 --> 00:20:19,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you intend to do with them?</font>

290
00:20:20,190 --> 00:20:23,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time, I will completely
destroy Leaf Village!</font>

291
00:20:24,200 --> 00:20:26,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! You must not believe
in their sweet talk...</font>

292
00:20:27,780 --> 00:20:28,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Their wishes...</font>

293
00:20:29,080 --> 00:20:33,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, Tsunade-sama, your wishes...
And dreams... Did you forget them?!</font>

294
00:20:33,540 --> 00:20:35,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be straight with you.</font>

295
00:20:35,250 --> 00:20:41,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tsunade, the village has demanded
that you become the Fifth Hokage.</font>

296
00:21:05,290 --> 00:21:10,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I BELIEVE YOUR PROMISE ITS TRUE HEART TO GIVE ME COURAGE</b></font></font>

297
00:21:05,290 --> 00:21:10,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I believe your promise, it's a true heart gives me courage</b></font></font>

298
00:21:10,290 --> 00:21:15,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

299
00:21:10,290 --> 00:21:15,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

300
00:21:15,260 --> 00:21:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>tachidomatta kado ni</b></font></font>

301
00:21:15,260 --> 00:21:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>on your still shoulder</b></font></font>

302
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:24,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>asu e mukau kaze wo kanjiteta</b></font></font>

303
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:24,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>I feel the wind that blows towards tomorrow</b></font></font>

304
00:21:24,700 --> 00:21:30,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>machi no akari hoshikuzu mitai ni</b></font></font>

305
00:21:24,700 --> 00:21:30,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>the city lights are like pieces of stars</b></font></font>

306
00:21:30,640 --> 00:21:35,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>futari tsutsumu kedo</b></font></font>

307
00:21:30,640 --> 00:21:35,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>that hold us together</b></font></font>

308
00:21:35,310 --> 00:21:44,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>sorezore ni chigau kagayaki ga aru to</b></font></font>

309
00:21:35,310 --> 00:21:44,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>"each one of us glows differently"</b></font></font>

310
00:21:44,620 --> 00:21:47,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>warau kimi ga</b></font></font>

311
00:21:44,620 --> 00:21:47,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you say laughingly</b></font></font>

312
00:21:47,500 --> 00:21:53,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ichiban mabushiku mieru yo</b></font></font>

313
00:21:47,500 --> 00:21:53,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>but you look most dazzling</b></font></font>

314
00:21:53,770 --> 00:21:58,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>yume wa ryuusei no you ni</b></font></font>

315
00:21:53,770 --> 00:21:58,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like a comet</b></font></font>

316
00:21:58,200 --> 00:22:04,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ameagari no niji no you ni</b></font></font>

317
00:21:58,200 --> 00:22:04,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>like the rainbow after the storm</b></font></font>

318
00:22:04,350 --> 00:22:12,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>kono kokoro ni hikari wo tsuretekuru</b></font></font>

319
00:22:04,350 --> 00:22:12,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>you bring light into my heart</b></font></font>

320
00:22:12,550 --> 00:22:23,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>nayami tsuzukeru koto ga hitotsu no kotae ni naruyo</b></font></font>

321
00:22:12,550 --> 00:22:23,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>being lost can be the answer</b></font></font>

322
00:22:23,230 --> 00:22:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>gomakashitari shinai to chikau no</b></font></font>

323
00:22:23,230 --> 00:22:30,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>let's promise we won't cheat</b></font></font>

324
00:22:30,670 --> 00:22:35,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>ALWAYS I FEEL IT THE PRECIOUS TIME WITH YOU</b></font></font>

325
00:22:30,670 --> 00:22:35,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Footlight MT Light"><b>always I feel it the precious time with you</b></font></font>

326
00:22:37,830 --> 00:22:40,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Damn it! What am I doing?!</font>

327
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:43,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I fell asleep at such
an important time!</font>

328
00:22:43,300 --> 00:22:45,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Moreover, today is the day
of the bet!</font>

329
00:22:45,550 --> 00:22:48,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Meanwhile, I don't even know where
Granny Tsunade has gone to!</font>

330
00:22:48,590 --> 00:22:52,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">My training is not completed yet...</font>

331
00:22:52,720 --> 00:22:57,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">I've got to play it by ear
and rely on a one-shot deal!</font>

332
00:22:58,560 --> 00:23:01,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Yes or No! Tsunade's Answer."</font>

